WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:05.837
The Current inventory tab on Products lists the parts vendors have in stock right now.

00:00:05.837 --> 00:00:08.155
Here, no stock has been entered yet.

00:00:08.607 --> 00:00:12.578
The stock is typed in by hand, on the part's vendor row, with the pencil.

00:00:23.193 --> 00:00:26.978
Type the number of pieces in Current Inventory, and click Save.

00:00:30.424 --> 00:00:35.695
On Vendors, the Current Inventory column counts how many of each vendor's parts are in stock.
